OL,3,GNEWSAEx-workers tell of 'chaotic
OL,4,Aatmosphere' at new #400m prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's newest prison has had a
OL,7,F"chaotic atmosphere" in its first 18
OL,8,Fmonths, former workers have told a BBC
OL,9,Finvestigation.
OL,11,FHMP Millsike, in East Yorkshire, was
OL,12,Fheralded by the government for setting
OL,13,F"the standard for the future" when it
OL,14,Fopened in March 2025 with 1,500 places.
OL,16,FBut former workers have described
OL,17,Funder-staffing, inadequate training and
OL,18,Fseeing specialist officers called in to
OL,19,Fdeal with serious incidents on numerous
OL,20,Foccasions.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
