OL,3,GNEWSAEx-workers tell of 'chaotic
OL,4,Aatmosphere' at new #400m prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FMitie, the company that runs the
OL,7,Fcategory C prison, said safety was its
OL,8,F"highest priority" and it was
OL,9,F"operating in line with plans agreed
OL,10,Fwith the Ministry of Justice".
